---
import Chart from "../Chart.astro";
import Choice from "../Choice.astro";
import Source from "../Source.astro";
import { text, type Lang } from "../../data";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = (z: string, e: string) => text(lang, z, e);
---

<Chart
  kind="energy"
  title={t("智能的背后，是物理基础设施", "Intelligence has a physical footprint")}
  description={t(
    "全球全部数据中心用电 · TWh · IEA 2026 报告版本",
    "Global electricity use of all data centres · TWh · IEA 2026 edition",
  )}
  ids={["iea"]}
  records={["energy-2025", "energy-2030"]}
  note={t(
    "485 TWh 是 2025 年的历史估计；约 950 TWh 是 2030 年的基准情景预测。数据中心运行着多种任务，不能全算在 AI 头上。",
    "485 TWh is the 2025 historical estimate; about 950 TWh is the 2030 central projection. Data centres host many workloads, not AI alone.",
  )}
>
  <div class="chart-controls">
    <Choice
      control="energy"
      label={t("展示方式", "Display")}
      options={[
        { value: "absolute", label: t("用电量", "Electricity") },
        { value: "index", label: t("相对指数", "Index") },
      ]}
    />
  </div>
</Chart>
<Chart
  kind="exposure"
  title={t(
    "工作会变，但不等于失业",
    "Work may change; exposure is not job loss",
  )}
  description={t(
    "ILO 2025 指数 · 各收入组中可能被 AI 触及的工作占比",
    "ILO 2025 index · potentially exposed share of employment in each income group",
  )}
  ids={["ilo"]}
  records={[
    "exposure-low",
    "exposure-global",
    "exposure-high",
    "exposure-highest",
  ]}
  note={t(
    "这些数字是各收入组中可能被 AI 触及的工作占比，既不是实际采用率，也不是岗位消失的概率。全球组已包含各收入组，不能相加。",
    "Potential exposure is not actual adoption or a probability of job loss. Global employment includes income groups; values are not additive.",
  )}
/>
<article class="editorial-card">
  <p class="hw-kicker">TASKS / TRANSFORMATION</p>
  <h2>
    {t(
      "重新分配任务，保留人的责任",
      "Reallocate tasks, retain human responsibility",
    )}
  </h2>
  <ol class="evidence-flow">
    {[
      t(
        "拆解岗位：检索、起草、沟通与判断",
        "Break work into retrieval, drafting, communication and judgment",
      ),
      t(
        "识别可辅助的任务，检查质量与成本",
        "Identify assistable tasks; check quality and cost",
      ),
      t(
        "培训与重组流程，持续验证结果",
        "Train people, redesign work and validate results",
      ),
    ].map((s) => (
      <li>{s}</li>
    ))}
  </ol>
  <Source ids={["ilo", "worldbank"]} />
</article>
<section class="hw-section">
  <div class="section-intro">
    <p class="hw-kicker">FOUNDATIONS FOR PROGRESS</p>
    <h2>{t("把条件补齐，收益才会发生", "Build the conditions for gains")}</h2>
    <p>
      {t(
        "以下是机制解释，不是国家或行业评分。",
        "These are mechanisms, not scores assigned to countries or industries.",
      )}
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="foundation-grid">
    {[
      [
        t("数据与连接", "Data & connectivity"),
        t(
          "数据可用，基础设施稳定",
          "Usable data, dependable infrastructure",
        ),
        t(
          "数据质量影响结果，连接条件决定谁能用上。",
          "Data quality shapes outputs; connectivity shapes access.",
        ),
      ],
      [
        t("人才与组织", "Skills & organizations"),
        t("学会用工具，也重设流程", "Learn the tools, redesign the work"),
        t(
          "培训、职责和复核机制，让新工具真正进入日常生产。",
          "Training, ownership, and review bring new tools into daily work.",
        ),
      ],
      [
        t("能源与效率", "Energy & efficiency"),
        t("收益与资源消耗一起考虑", "Account for gains and resources"),
        t(
          "模型更高效、部署更合理，基础设施的压力才会降下来。",
          "Efficient models and deployment can ease infrastructure demands.",
        ),
      ],
    ].map((a, i) => (
      <article>
        <span class="concept-number">0{i + 1}</span>
        <h3>{a[0]}</h3>
        <strong>{a[1]}</strong>
        <p>{a[2]}</p>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
  <Source ids={["worldbank", "iea"]} />
</section>
